# Code owners of the policy files (decision 0011, #48).
#
# A change to a registry, team or profile file is a change to what the gateway serves and to
# whom, so it needs review by a code owner. The branch rule on main that requires that review
# is set in the repository's settings, not here. GitHub reads this file from the pull
# request's base branch, and the last pattern that matches a path decides its owners.
#
# The directories that hold registries are named, which covers any file added to them later.
# The name patterns cover every registry, team or profile file under deploy/ or crates/,
# wherever it is added.

# Registries: the registry crate's demo file, and those the demos and CI load.
/crates/gateway-registry/demo/            @ambientself
/deploy/compose/config/registry/          @ambientself
/deploy/kind/base/config/registry/        @ambientself
/deploy/ci/**/registry/                   @ambientself
/deploy/**/registry*.toml                 @ambientself
/crates/**/registry*.toml                 @ambientself

# Team manifests: which subject belongs to which team.
/deploy/**/teams*.toml                    @ambientself
/crates/**/teams*.toml                    @ambientself

# Profiles. Today they are sections of the registry files above; a separate profile file
# would be owned too.
/deploy/**/profile*.toml                  @ambientself
/crates/**/profile*.toml                  @ambientself

# This file, so the list of owners cannot change without their review.
/.github/CODEOWNERS                       @ambientself
